# Long River's Pull {U}{U}: with the gift declined it counters only a creature spell. Bot2's Lightning Bolt aimed at Bot1 is not
# one: with the gift declined the Pull has no legal target, so the cast is called off (the Pull stays in Bot1's hand, unspent)
# and the Bolt resolves, leaving Bot1 at 17.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Long River's Pull
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
? Stack = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Long River's Pull.Cast
Bot1.Decline
? Stack = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
